join bananazon_interviewer center

bananazon_interviewer (netral): Kenapa anda tertarik untuk mendaftar ke eco-sigma

[signal arg="timer_start"]

- Karena saya mau membantu melestarikan alam
	set {interview_score} += 8
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	bananazon_interviewer (senang): Saya suka jawaban anda
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Saya suka melihat pohon
	set {interview_score} -= 3
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	bananazon_interviewer (marah): oh begitu ya...
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

- saya punya value yang bapak inginkan
	set {interview_score} += 12
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	bananazon_interviewer (sangat senang): ah... saya akan catat dan semoga anda benar
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- butuh duit pak
	set {interview_score} -= 8
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	bananazon_interviewer (marah): ahahah, anda sangat jujur ya
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]
